The glyph registry of this package (src/components/Icon/glyphs.ts) carries third-party artwork. Each glyph's own entry names its
source; the notices and licences it requires are below. The artwork was changed for this package: neutral paints bind to
currentColor, shapes are converted to path data and merged into one path per paint, coordinates are rounded to three decimals.

