The font files of this package (fonts/, built into dist/assets/) are the design mock's UI faces. Each is a subset of its source file (the
characters of its unicode-range, in src/styles/fonts.css) converted to WOFF2; hinting, every layout feature and the name table, which holds the
copyright and the licence, are kept (scripts/subset-fonts.ts, fonts/manifest.json). Both licences allow this change and reserve no font name,
so the faces keep their names. Each licence below is copied verbatim and applies to the files named above it.

